“You both look incredible.”

Draco nodded curtly, Hermione squeezed Theo’s bicep. “Thank you, so do you!” She exclaimed, looking his crisp attire up and down.

Theo was wearing a dark purple suit with silver accents. “Where are the girls?” She wondered.
